1
00:01:46,882 --> 00:01:49,966
虽然曼特城的暴乱终于平息下来了
Although rioting in Mantle is finally under control,

2
00:01:50,257 --> 00:01:53,882
但在得知大部分暴乱分子是你的支持者时 你有何感想呢?
how does it feel to know that the majority of those involved were your supporters?

3
00:01:54,382 --> 00:01:56,091
我绝不支持暴乱行为
I don't condone rioting,

4
00:01:56,632 --> 00:02:01,424
尤其是当上面已经拒绝在我们的城市困难时给予援助
especially when our city is being denied aid for the hardships we've already had to go through,

5
00:02:02,091 --> 00:02:07,007
而杰克·雪倪的新阴谋则让这座城市成为了他自身政治利益的人质
but Jacques Schnee's latest stunt is holding the city hostage for his own political gain.

6
00:02:07,049 --> 00:02:09,007
所以 我明白他们的愤怒
So I understand their anger,

7
00:02:09,299 --> 00:02:11,757
但我希望他们不要将愤怒发泄到外面
but ask that they show it not in the streets

8
00:02:11,799 --> 00:02:13,299
而是将其投入到今天的投票中
but at the polls today.

9
00:02:14,549 --> 00:02:16,174
哈! 呀!
Ah, ah!

10
00:02:46,424 --> 00:02:48,674
真棒 你的恢复速度更快了
Nice, your recovery is getting faster.

11
00:02:56,299 --> 00:02:58,924
你之前就会这招吗?
Have you always been able to do that?

12
00:02:59,966 --> 00:03:00,924
我不知道
I don't know.

13
00:03:01,216 --> 00:03:03,424
我平时也不怎么去考虑这些
I don't normally think it through that much.

14
00:03:03,549 --> 00:03:04,716
你们都在进化
You guys are evolving

15
00:03:04,966 --> 00:03:07,091
我却依然没有外相力
and I still don't even have my Semblance.

16
00:03:07,424 --> 00:03:10,341
等你有了之后我们肯定都会嫉妒你的
Well, I bet we'll all be jealous when you do.

17
00:03:13,841 --> 00:03:14,966
克洛弗没在说笑
Clover wasn't kidding.

18
00:03:15,299 --> 00:03:16,716
你们真的在拼尽全力
You're really giving this your all.

19
00:03:16,882 --> 00:03:18,716
依现状看来 我们只能这么做了
Well, we have to with the way things are going.

20
00:03:20,216 --> 00:03:21,507
情况不是很乐观 是吗?
They're not going well, are they?

21
00:03:22,049 --> 00:03:23,591
罗宾总比杰克·雪倪要好
Better Robyn then Jacques Schnee.

22
00:03:23,632 --> 00:03:25,591
噢 大概是吧
Oh, Isuppose so.

23
00:03:25,632 --> 00:03:28,924
无论如何 今天的选举将会影响目前的稳定
Either way, this election doesn't bode well for our stability.

24
00:03:29,424 --> 00:03:33,591
这或许是个跟罗宾合作 获得曼特城支持的好机会
It could be a chance to work with Robyn and get Mantle on your side.

25
00:03:33,632 --> 00:03:35,591
这个可能性不太--
The likelihood of that working -

26
00:03:35,632 --> 00:03:36,507
她说得对
She's right,

27
00:03:36,549 --> 00:03:38,507
你得让曼特城的现状有所改变
you have to do something about Mantle.

28
00:03:38,549 --> 00:03:40,507
只要你能让罗宾信任你
if you could get Robyn to trust you.

29
00:03:40,549 --> 00:03:43,966
我打赌 如果你对她敞开心扉 她会理解你是被诬陷的
I bet if you opened up to her shed understand that you're being framed.

30
00:03:44,716 --> 00:03:45,341
也许吧
Perhaps,

31
00:03:46,257 --> 00:03:49,299
前提是她也愿意对我们敞开心扉
but it will only work if she's open too.

32
00:03:49,632 --> 00:03:51,549
我想你们是为了分配新任务才来的吧
I take it you're here for new mission assignments.

33
00:03:52,257 --> 00:03:53,424
可以这么说
You could say that.

34
00:03:53,799 --> 00:03:56,966
将军和我想让你们用今天剩下的时间来调整身心
The General and I want you to take the rest of the day to recuperate.

35
00:03:57,549 --> 00:03:59,507
今晚我们放假?
You're giving us a night off?

36
00:04:00,257 --> 00:04:01,007
这是命令
Ordering it.

37
00:04:01,466 --> 00:04:02,716
在今晚的选举后
After tonight's election,

38
00:04:02,757 --> 00:04:05,174
明天我们将面对的是截然不同的曼特城
we'll be waking up to a very different Atlas tomorrow.

39
00:04:05,591 --> 00:04:08,299
我需要你们好好休息 准备好应对接下来的任何状况
I need you rested and ready for whatever that may bring.

40
00:04:11,507 --> 00:04:13,174
离最终结果公布还有几个小时
We still have hours ahead of us,

41
00:04:13,424 --> 00:04:19,716
但照目前的情况来看 罗宾‧休将会填补议会的席位空缺
but as votes come in, it looks more and more certain that Robyn Hill will fill the open council seat.

42
00:04:20,632 --> 00:04:24,341
父亲绝不可能认为遣散产业会对自己有任何的益处
There's no way my father could've thought layoffs would do anything but hurt him.

43
00:04:24,549 --> 00:04:27,507
所以 他为什么会在选举的前一天宣布这种事?
So why announce this the day before the election?

44
00:04:27,757 --> 00:04:30,049
在我看来这就是次失败了的高压攻势
Just seems like a power play that backfired to me.

45
00:04:30,091 --> 00:04:32,049
几小时后这也就无所谓了
Won't matter in a few hours though.

46
00:04:33,257 --> 00:04:34,382
你们要去哪?
Where are you guys going?

47
00:04:34,424 --> 00:04:36,382
FNKI小队请我们去跳舞
Team FNKI invited us out dancing.

48
00:04:36,591 --> 00:04:39,174
Yang跟我都觉得现在还是不要去想选举的事比较好
Yang and I thought it would be good to get our minds off the election.

49
00:04:39,466 --> 00:04:42,091
你不是觉得FNKI小队很烦人吗
I thought you said Team FNKI was annoying.

50
00:04:42,799 --> 00:04:45,007
这就是迪厅最好的一点
That's the best part about dance clubs.

51
00:04:45,049 --> 00:04:46,591
我听不见你说话
I can't hear you.

52
00:04:48,216 --> 00:04:49,882
Ruby 快来!
Ruby come on!

53
00:04:50,424 --> 00:04:52,424
我还是不敢相信你真要去蹦迪
I still can't beljeve you're going to that thing.

54
00:04:52,674 --> 00:04:56,216
埃隆伍德讨厌罗宾 不代表我们都要讨厌她呀
Just because Ironwood dislikes Robyn doesn't mean we all have to.

55
00:04:56,424 --> 00:05:00,632
从我的角度看来 他俩都在努力帮助擎天
From where I'm standing, both of them seem to be trying their best to help Atlas.

56
00:05:01,007 --> 00:05:02,632
至于谁做得更好嘛...
As to who's doing a better job...

57
00:05:04,257 --> 00:05:05,674
但是 庆功趴?
But a victory party?

58
00:05:05,716 --> 00:05:07,674
你想来的话现在还可以加入哦
Invite's still open if you want in.

59
00:05:07,716 --> 00:05:09,674
Penny要去做安保工作
Penny's gonna be working security.

60
00:05:11,924 --> 00:05:14,799
天惹 不对 你得这么蹦
Oh my gosh, no. You gotta do it like this.

61
00:05:15,549 --> 00:05:16,924
我明明就是这么蹦的!
That's what I'm doing!

62
00:05:17,966 --> 00:05:19,966
嘿 奥斯卡和我想去看个电影如果有人想一起的话--
Hey, Oscar and I are hitting the movies if anyone wants --

63
00:05:20,007 --> 00:05:20,257
我去
Yup!

64
00:05:20,299 --> 00:05:22,257
噢噢 好
Oh, okay.

65
00:05:26,341 --> 00:05:28,216
我其实能理解Weiss的看法
I understand Weiss' point though,

66
00:05:28,882 --> 00:05:31,007
庆功趴的确有些幼稚
a victory party does seem a bit premature.

67
00:05:31,049 --> 00:05:33,341
哎呀 就让他们有信心一次嘛
Aw, let them have one sure thing.

68
00:05:33,674 --> 00:05:36,882
这或许就是在阿米特通讯塔发射前 在所有人得知
Probably the last sure thing before Amity Tower goes up

69
00:05:36,924 --> 00:05:39,882
我们在对抗什么之前 人们最有信心的一刻了
and everyone learns about...what we're fighting.

70
00:05:40,174 --> 00:05:44,049
我们花了这么长时间担心埃隆伍德知道关于她的真相后的反应
We spent so much time worrying about how Ironwood will react to the truth about her,

71
00:05:44,257 --> 00:05:45,424
但我们之中有任何人考虑过
but have any of us considered

72
00:05:45,466 --> 00:05:47,966
在那之后 我们要如何打败她吗?
how we're even going to beat her if we manage to work past that?

73
00:05:48,466 --> 00:05:49,966
灯神说她是无法被打败的
Jinn said she can't be beaten.

74
00:05:50,341 --> 00:05:52,549
她也跟奥兹说他无法毁灭她
She told Oz that he couldn't destroy her.

75
00:05:53,424 --> 00:05:55,841
或许别人可以?
But maybe someone else could?

76
00:05:57,216 --> 00:05:58,049
我不知道
I don't know.

77
00:05:59,549 --> 00:06:01,049
我们现在应该在训练
We should be training right now.

78
00:06:01,091 --> 00:06:02,299
我们训练得够多了!
We've trained enough!

79
00:06:02,341 --> 00:06:03,424
稍微花时间放松 --
Take some time to --

80
00:06:03,466 --> 00:06:05,424
我们没有时间了!
We don't have time!

81
00:06:20,382 --> 00:06:22,716
Ruby, Nora, Ren!
Ruby, Nora, Ren!

82
00:06:23,632 --> 00:06:24,549
嘿 Penny
Hey, Penny.

83
00:06:24,591 --> 00:06:26,174
你们能来我太高兴了
I am so glad you made it.

84
00:06:26,216 --> 00:06:27,924
今晚只有我和马罗在这里
It's just Marrow and I tonight,

85
00:06:27,966 --> 00:06:29,924
所以更多朋友能来就更有意思
so more friends means more fun.

86
00:06:30,549 --> 00:06:31,632
其他人呢?
Where are the others?

87
00:06:31,799 --> 00:06:33,257
Weiss跟男孩子们出去了
Weiss is out with the boys,

88
00:06:33,299 --> 00:06:35,966
Blake和Yang去做自己的事了
and Blake and Yang are off doing their own thing,

89
00:06:36,007 --> 00:06:37,007
又一次
Again.

90
00:06:37,049 --> 00:06:39,007
至少她们变回朋友了
At least they're back to being friends.

91
00:06:39,049 --> 00:06:41,091
朋友是吗?只是朋友?
Friends, huh? Just friends?

92
00:06:41,132 --> 00:06:43,966
不然还能是什么?
What else would they be?

93
00:06:44,257 --> 00:06:46,799
两个一起经历过那么多的人
Two people who've gone through that much,

94
00:06:47,216 --> 00:06:48,799
我想里面的关系可比朋友深
I think there's more going on.

95
00:06:48,841 --> 00:06:50,299
或许其中一个是这么想的
Well maybe one of them feels that way

96
00:06:50,341 --> 00:06:51,299
但另一个可能还在担心
but the other might be worried.

97
00:06:51,341 --> 00:06:52,257
担心什么?!
About what?

98
00:06:52,299 --> 00:06:55,257
就 只是 现在发生了很多事
It's just, there's a lot of things going on right now

99
00:06:55,591 --> 00:06:56,716
她们如果不聊聊的话又怎么能把状况捋清楚呢?
Well, how can they figure things out if they don't talk about it?

100
00:06:56,757 --> 00:06:58,716
我觉得我搞不懂了
I believe 1 may be confused.

101
00:06:58,757 --> 00:07:00,341
我们在说谁来着?
Who are we talking about again?

102
00:07:00,382 --> 00:07:01,799
我也不清楚了
I'm not really sure.

103
00:07:02,466 --> 00:07:04,841
Penny你去哪了?
Penny, where'd you go?

104
00:07:04,882 --> 00:07:06,841
请别离开我!
Please don't leave me!

105
00:07:10,049 --> 00:07:14,132
噢你好啊 你在这干啥呢?
Oh hey, what -- what're you doing here?

106
00:07:14,382 --> 00:07:17,007
只是在朋友工作时陪陪她嘛
Just hangin' out with a friend while she's on the job.

107
00:07:21,216 --> 00:07:22,549
真可爱
Yeah, real cute.!

108
00:07:22,716 --> 00:07:26,549
注意别太干扰到 我们要非常警觉以备--
Look, try not to be too much of a distraction. We need to be vigilant in case -

109
00:07:26,591 --> 00:07:27,757
以备什么?
In case what?

110
00:07:28,341 --> 00:07:31,091
免得有人要找麻烦
In case someone tries to start trouble.

111
00:07:31,382 --> 00:07:34,216
真有趣 所以我们在这呢
Oh, funny, that's why we're here.

112
00:07:34,257 --> 00:07:35,799
一边凉快去吧
So feel free to take a hike.

113
00:07:35,966 --> 00:07:39,507
听着 将军只是想帮忙好吗 就因为你不了解--
Listen, the General's trying to help, all right?Just 'cause you cant understand --

114
00:07:39,549 --> 00:07:41,049
怎么了 姐妹们
What's going on here, Wags?

115
00:07:41,924 --> 00:07:44,049
哦 小不点又来了
Oh, and the pipsqueak is back.

116
00:07:45,716 --> 00:07:49,007
我们是担心安保风险 女士
We're concerned about security risks, ma'am.

117
00:07:49,382 --> 00:07:51,757
将军不想今晚有什么差错
The General doesn't want any surprises tonight.

118
00:07:56,716 --> 00:07:58,799
行吧 但别挡道
Fine, but stay out of the way.

119
00:08:00,007 --> 00:08:03,716
如果我当选了 我们都得学学怎么相处
If I get elected tonight, we'll all have to learn how to get along.

120
00:08:06,924 --> 00:08:11,257
当然 只要你遵纪守法 我们之间就没有问题
Sure, we won't have any problems, as long as you stay within the law.

121
00:08:12,341 --> 00:08:16,091
法律不完美 也不平等
The law isn't perfect, you know. It's certainly not equal.

122
00:08:16,132 --> 00:08:18,091
相信我 我非常清楚
Trust me, I'm well aware.

123
00:08:18,591 --> 00:08:23,174
我唯一的目的就是让曼特和擎天的公民 包括弗纳人
My only goal is that all the citizens of Mantle and Atlas and Faunus

124
00:08:23,424 --> 00:08:25,257
有平等的机会为好生活奋斗
have an equal shot at a good life.

125
00:08:25,632 --> 00:08:26,549
听起来不错
That sounds great.

126
00:08:27,049 --> 00:08:29,924
而且你打算合法地实现这种平等 对吗?
And you're planning to do all that equalizing legally, right?

127
00:08:31,716 --> 00:08:33,757
我所做的都是合法的
Everything I've done is legal.

128
00:08:34,591 --> 00:08:37,132
当然 百分之百
Of course, 100%.

129
00:08:39,507 --> 00:08:41,716
好吧 这下管用了
Ha-ha, well, that worked.

130
00:08:50,674 --> 00:08:53,507
走吧孩子们 我们还有正事要干
Scram kid, we've got a job to do.

131
00:09:07,091 --> 00:09:09,591
我们能不能别在这时候吵架?
Can we please just not do this right now?

132
00:09:10,382 --> 00:09:12,507
我就该去看电影的
I should've just gone to the movies.

133
00:09:13,132 --> 00:09:16,257
我想感谢所有今天投票的人
I want to thank everyone for going to the polls today.

134
00:09:16,674 --> 00:09:18,132
这是曼特的时刻
This is Mantle's moment.

135
00:09:21,507 --> 00:09:27,132
我知道 像我一样 你们都为选择罗宾成为我们在擎天的代表而激动
I know that, like me, you're all thrilled that we chose Robyn as our voice in Atlas.

136
00:09:27,966 --> 00:09:31,382
没人像她一样如此为曼特奋斗
No one has fought harder for Mantle than she has.

137
00:09:31,716 --> 00:09:37,341
而且.. 我知道罗宾会继续在议会里奋斗
And... 1 know Robyn will continue that fight on the Council

138
00:09:39,216 --> 00:09:40,882
你能说几句吗?
Will you share a few words?

139
00:09:54,757 --> 00:09:56,966
我不太擅长演说
I've never been much for public speaking,

140
00:09:57,632 --> 00:10:00,257
从政恐怕不是个好选择
probably wasn't my best idea ever to go into politics.

141
00:10:02,674 --> 00:10:06,049
感谢你们所有人投我的票
Thank you so much, everyone, for choosing me.

142
00:10:06,507 --> 00:10:11,382
你们说你们信任我 但其实是我由衷地信任你们
You said you believe in me. But I'm the one who believes in all of you.

143
00:10:11,924 --> 00:10:15,924
你们已经向我证明了 作为个人 我们强大
You've proven to me that as individuals, we are strong.

144
00:10:16,507 --> 00:10:18,757
而团结一致 我们不可阻挡
But together, we're unstoppable.

145
00:10:21,466 --> 00:10:27,466
所以今晚无论结果如何 输或赢 我们都会继续为我们的城市奋斗
So no matter what happens tonight, win or lose, we will continue to fight for our city,

146
00:10:27,632 --> 00:10:30,924
因为是这座城市让我们团结一心
because it is this city that brings us together.

147
00:10:35,966 --> 00:10:41,007
现在到最后时刻了 竞争要比预想的激烈
We're in the final minutes now, and it's looking to be a closer race than anticipated.

148
00:10:42,966 --> 00:10:45,341
别担心 手到擒来
Don't worry, it's in the bag.

149
00:10:53,716 --> 00:10:56,132
Ren 你怎么回事啊?
Ren, what's going on?

150
00:10:56,174 --> 00:10:58,132
为什么你不和我谈谈呢?
Why won't you just talk to me?

151
00:10:59,341 --> 00:11:03,799
你知道我从来都不那么擅长谈话
You know I've never been really good with talking.

152
00:11:04,966 --> 00:11:06,299
那就去他丫的谈话!
Then screw talking!

153
00:11:29,091 --> 00:11:30,216
特里安 你准备好了吗?
You ready, Tyrian?

154
00:11:32,049 --> 00:11:33,049
一如既往
Always.

155
00:11:33,966 --> 00:11:37,799
投票就要结束了 倒计时12 11
The polls are about to close. 12, 11--

156
00:11:37,966 --> 00:11:45,382
10 9 8 7 6 5 4 3--
ten, nine, eight, seven, six, five, four, three--

157
00:11:46,716 --> 00:11:47,966
小心!
Watch out!

158
00:11:52,049 --> 00:11:53,007
动手
Go.

159
00:12:04,257 --> 00:12:05,841
Penny 发生什么了?
Penny, what's going on over there?

160
00:12:10,132 --> 00:12:12,216
放下武器投降!
Put down your weapon and surrender!

161
00:12:15,549 --> 00:12:18,466
这里是金牌特工马罗·请求立即支援
This is Ace Operative Marrow,requesting immediate assistance!

162
00:12:20,799 --> 00:12:22,382
猎人们 向我靠拢!
Huntresses, to me!

163
00:12:22,424 --> 00:12:24,382
我们得把你送出去!
Come on, we've gotta get you outta here!

164
00:12:29,632 --> 00:12:30,174
罗宾!
Robyn!

165
00:12:47,591 --> 00:12:49,216
时机正好!
Right on time!

166
00:12:57,174 --> 00:13:01,049
擎天议会选举的胜者为
And the winner of the Atlas Council election is...

167
00:13:01,466 --> 00:13:03,049
杰克·雪倪!
Jacques Schnee!

168
00:13:07,341 --> 00:13:09,091
是埃隆伍德的机器人
It's Ironwood's robot!

169
00:13:09,799 --> 00:13:10,341
Penny
Penny.

170
00:13:13,382 --> 00:13:15,549
我 我没有
I-- I didn't.

171
00:13:15,591 --> 00:13:18,216
噢谢谢大家 谢谢你们
O-ho, thank you everyone, thank you.

172
00:13:18,341 --> 00:13:22,424
因为你们 这是擎天崭新的一天
It's all because of you.It's a new day in Atlas.

173
00:13:23,049 --> 00:13:24,757
我们赢了 我们做到了!
We've won, we did it!

174
00:13:26,216 --> 00:13:27,174
怎么回事?
What happened?

175
00:13:27,382 --> 00:13:29,716
是特里安 特里安在这!
It was Tyrian, Tyrian's here!

176
00:13:35,757 --> 00:13:36,591
待着!
Stay!

177
00:13:38,924 --> 00:13:41,007
快把penny带走!
Get Penny out the back, now!

178
00:13:49,507 --> 00:13:51,716
我没事 我没事
I'm okay, I'm okay.

179
00:13:53,007 --> 00:13:55,632
我很抱歉 她—
I'm sorry, is she --

180
00:14:01,591 --> 00:14:03,632
不是我们干的 我发誓
This wasn't us, I swear.

181
00:14:10,549 --> 00:14:15,091
干得漂亮 特里安 今晚可以收工了
Fine work, Tyrian. I think we are done for tonight.

182
00:14:20,716 --> 00:14:25,799
雪倪尘晶矿业的CEO 杰克·雪倪取得了意外的胜利
A surprise victory by SDC Mining Corporation's CEO, Jacques Schnee.

183
00:14:26,049 --> 00:14:30,716
最后的投票结果让这位尘晶产业领袖成为了黑马
Last minute voter turnout produced a dark horse victory for the dust industry leader.

184
00:14:41,507 --> 00:14:44,049
Penny 你得回到擎天去
Penny, you need to get to Atlas.

185
00:14:44,632 --> 00:14:45,507
支援已经在路上了
Backup's on the way.

186
00:14:47,841 --> 00:14:48,632
Penny?
Penny?

187
00:14:56,882 --> 00:14:57,466
戮兽
Grimm.

188
00:14:59,216 --> 00:15:01,174
夜晚还长着呐
We've got a long night ahead.

189
00:15:02,424 --> 00:15:05,091
作为新任议员
And as the newest member of the Council,

190
00:15:05,257 --> 00:15:11,341
我宣誓为每个擎天和曼特的公民服务
I pledge to serve each and every citizen of Mantle and Atlas.